{
  "schemaVersion": "intentional-public-api",
  "description": "Media public-type ownership for the standalone ghatana-media repository. Every compiled public type in a java-module surface resolves to exactly one ownership entry. Requirement IDs reference the canonical Media requirement registry in .product-experience/pdp-0-product-truth/requirements.yaml and nonfunctional-requirements.yaml; a Gradle-readable requirements authority does not yet exist for this repository, so IDs are validated against the canonical registry by review rather than by the task's requirements table.",
